Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:18:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] estuary: the legend of the table of the levels holds in two
 lines

In Spanish the legend of the table of the metadata levels ("Que usa: ...
Enviados: lo que recibe la TV.") took three lines in its 454 px, and Kodi drew
the third under the label, over the first row of the page (a picture of the
page in QEMU showed it; the checker of the texts lets a label of 64 px take a
third line that starts inside it). The columns of the levels are 72 px instead
of 78, which leaves the legend 526 px, and the label is 62 px, two lines, so
that the checker would see a third one. Checked in the four languages.
---
